@startuml Composants_Unity
' Diagramme de composants --- scripts principaux Unity (Immersio)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ArrowColor #2B4B6F
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #183D5D
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #0E2740
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #E8EEF4
  BorderColor #183D5D
  FontColor #000000
}

title Composants principaux de l'application Unity

package "Communication & état" {
  [TynassApiClient] as API
  [AppSession] as Session
}

package "Navigation & UI" {
  [PanelManager] as Panel
  [EmployeeSignInPanel] as SignIn
  [ModulesPanel] as Modules
  [SettingsPanel] as Settings
}

package "Activation & scènes" {
  [LoadingManager] as Loading
  [DeviceActivationManager] as Device
}

API --> Session : lit / écrit l'état global
Device -> Loading : attend l'écran de chargement
Device -> API : check / activation casque
SignIn ----> API : login employé
SignIn ----> Session : sauvegarde la session
Modules ---> API : charge les formations
Modules -> Loading : charge la scène choisie
Panel --> SignIn
Panel --> Modules
Panel --> Settings
Settings ---> Session : réglages persistants (PlayerPrefs)


note bottom of Session : Classe statique globale :\ntoken, employé, formation, quiz.
@enduml
